OL,3,GNEWSA'I trained hearing dogs for years
OL,4,A- then needed my own'
OL,5,
OL,6,FWhen Kevin Rafferty from Ripon retired
OL,7,Fin 2015, he decided he wanted to foster
OL,8,Fand train hearing dogs to help deaf
OL,9,Fpeople. When he started to experience
OL,10,Fdeafness himself a few years later, he
OL,11,Fneeded a dog of his own.
OL,13,F"We started when we retired, in order
OL,14,Fto have a dog in the house again,"
OL,15,Fremembers the 76-year-old.
OL,17,F"We thoroughly enjoyed it and always
OL,18,Ftalked about the fact that the end
OL,19,Fresult was going to be he was going to
OL,20,Fgo and change somebody's life, as I now
OL,21,Frealise with Dexter."
OL,23,APub: 19-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
