OL,3,GNEWSA'I trained hearing dogs for years
OL,4,A- then needed my own'
OL,5,
OL,6,FKevin is one of 68 people in Yorkshire
OL,7,Fwho are currently partnered with a
OL,8,Fhearing dog, in his case a Cocker
OL,9,FSpaniel named Dexter, from the charity
OL,10,FHearing Dogs for Deaf People.
